\section{Triangulation}{

A \code{triangulate} node reads every lens it consumes, each a manifest whose
summary metrics carry \code{effect_present} or \code{influence_present}, and at most
one gate. It emits one of seven consensus headlines:
\code{causal_effect_corroborated} (two or more lenses, all with an effect),
\code{no_effect_corroborated} (two or more, none with an effect),
\code{single_lens_effect} and \code{single_lens_no_effect} (one lens),
\code{disagreement_flagged} (mixed), and \code{abstain} (the gate abstained in flag
mode, or no lens survived a reroute).
